<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu kya Wagalatia kiyandikilwa na mndumindumi Paulo 1:1. Lihamba hali Paulo awayandikilili mapinga gha wakwinila Kilisito gha haku mbwani Galatia lipindi linguwesa kuwela 48-57 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito. Wagalatia wawelili wandu wangulikala kumlima ungulongoswa na Lomani. Wasomi waweli na uchakaka ng'ogha yiwa Paulo aweli kugha lipindi awelili anguyandika lihamba hali, ila mimbwani gha Efesu na Kolintu ni chakaka awelili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo anguwayandikila wakilisito, wogha Wayahudi na Wayahudi ng'ogha, wa mapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito gha haku Galatia. Awayandikilili ili kuwangingama wala wavulile kwa uhwangi wangulonga wakilisito wangupalwa kukovekela malaghilo gha Wayahudi kuhuma ku Lilaghano lya dahile, nesunesu lilaghilo lya kuyingisa jandu. Kuwelili na lipinga limonga lya wakilisito wamayaghani waikemili Wayudaiza weni wanguwapala wakilisito waweli Wayahudi ng'ogha wangupalwa wayingiswi jandu. Hilahila wakamkonya Paulo kukovekelana na ukulu wa undumindumi ghaki. Paulo akawayanga kwa kuwalongela habali zyaki sula gha 1:11-2:14 na kutetela Habali Maha kwa kulongela yiwa utepokela ulokola kwa kumkwinila Kilisito Yesu sula gha 2:16. Hai ni kwa umaha wa Sapanga na ng'ogha kwa matendu gha wandu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula lihamba kwa kujambusa mapinga gha wakwinila Kilisito haku Galatia sula gha 1:1-5</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu Paulo angulongela habali ghaki kwa kutetela uweso ghaki wa kuvula na kulangiha kwa kulama kwa kusaghamila laghililo ila hai laghililo isindilwi sula gha 1:6-2:21</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi angulongelela kwa utali lukani lwa laghililo na umaha wa ulokola sula gha 3-4</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu Paulo angulaghila vila wakilisito wangupalwa kulama kwa umaha sula gha 5:1-6:10</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu Paulo anguyomola lihamba lyaki kwa kujambusa na kuluwa kwa kukumbikwe yiwa kugalambulwa na Sapanga kuwela mundu myohnu nk maha nesu kupiti kukovekela laghililo sula gha 6:11-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Nenga Paulo mwenikuwela mndumindumi ng'ogha kwa uweso wa mundu ila kwa uwesa wa Yesu Kilisito, ninguyandika lihamba hali kwa makakala gha Sapanga Tati mwenikumuhindula Yesu, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />na wandu wogha wenikwimkwinila Kilisito pamonga na nenga, tunguwajambusa mwenga lipinga lya wenikumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Galatia.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Ningumyupa Tati Sapanga wa twenga pamonga na Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito awapeghi umaha ghaki na mlikali kwa kuponga. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yesu ajihumisili mweni aweli litambiku kwaikiva gha kuhumiswa sambi sya twenga ili atuviki pekesu kuhuma kuuhakata wa mlima wogha hau. Hali ndiwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga alipalile.<verse eid="GAL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Sapanga ni mkulu na angupalwa asifilwi machuwa hyogha bila mwihu! Hina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habali Maha ni imonga hela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Nenga ningulikangasa kwa mwenga kumleka Sapanga kwa kuloposela kulipindi lihupi, hayu mweni kuwakema mwenga kwa kupitila Kilisito, na kuhyukila habali gha njila ghangi, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />kwahela Habali Maha ighangi, ila kunguwoneka kuwela na wandu weni kuwahanganya, wakipala kubyodosa Habali Maha gha Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Twenga tuwatangasilile mwenga ujumbi wa Habali Maha weka. Hinu Sapanga amnyokoli yeyosi mweni kuwatangasila mwenga ujumbi mghangi, hata paiwela mmonga paghati gha twenga au mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Tulilongela kala hali, ila hinaa nitelongela kangi. Mkotoho kujumila ujumbi wowosi kihyetu na hula tuwavulile. Paikawela yeyosi kawavula ujumbi mghangi, Ningumyupa Sapanga amnyokoli nesu!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Kwa nagha nenga ningupala kumuhekelesa ghani, kuwahekelesa wandu au Sapanga? Ningalipala kuwahekelesa wandu ningaliwela ng'ogha mndumindumi wa Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kakemwa kuwela mndumindumi wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Walongo wa nenga ningupala kuwamanyisa yiwa Habali Maha niwatangasilile iwelili ng'ogha gha kimundu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Kwaikiva niipokelili ng'ogha kwa wandu wala kuvulwa na wandu, ila Yesu Kilisito ndiwa mweni kunigubutulila.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Mwenga myoghanila kala vila niwelili nikilama haku kuhyetu paniwelili kunjila gha kumyupa Sapanga gha Kiyahudi, vila nilihakilile lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito bila luhungu na kupala kuliyalamisa. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Nenga niyangalile nesu kuyendana na njila gha kumyupa Sapanga gha Kiyahudi kupiti Wayahudi waghangi wa machuva ghangu, na kukola mawachilo gha wagogolo wa twenga.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ila Sapanga, kwa umaha ghaki, awelili kanihaghula kuhuma mumtima wa nyongo ghangu akanikema nimtumikili. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Pala paalamulile kumlangiha Mwana ghaki lipalalipala kwa nenga, lukani nitangasi Habali Maha ghaki kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi, lipindi hali nimlongela ng'ogha mundu yoyosi mghalu hau, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />wala kuyenda ku Yelusalemu kwa wala wapatile undumindumi pambila gha nenga, niyendili huti kumlima wa ku Alabia, hinu nikahuya kangi kummbwani wa Damasiki. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Hinu badili gha machuva maitatu nikakwela kuyenda ku Yelusalemu kukongine na Petelo na nilikalile na mweni kwa lipindi lya machuwa ikumi na mhano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Haku nimlolile ng'ogha mndumindumi mghangi yoyosi ila Yakobu, mlongo ghaki Bambu Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Sapanga mweni angumanya yiwa hagha ninguwayandikila ni chakaka.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Kuulongolo ghaki nikayenda kumlima wa Silia mahala wekaweka na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Lipindi lila nenga niwelili ng'ogha nikimanyika kulipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito gha kula kumbwani gha Yudasia. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ila yawelili yakiyoghanila hela yiwa, “Mundu yula mwenikuwela akituhakila haku dahile hinaa angutangasa Habali Maha gha ukwinila hula awelili akiyesa kuuyalamisa.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Hinu wakamsifila Sapanga kwaikiva gha nenga.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na wandumindumi waghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Hinu badili gha machuva ikumi na minjechi nikahuya kangi ku Yelusalemu nikiwela na Balinaba na hilahila ni kamtola Titusi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nenga niyendili kula kwaikiva gha kuyitikila kila anilongilile Sapanga yiwa niyendi haku, haku nikakongana na vilongosi weka yau. Nikawalongela hula ujumbi wa Habali Maha nitangasili kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi, nigholile nagha kwaikiva nipalile ng'ogha kulola lihengu lyangu lya mtumbulo au lya hinaa linguyalamika. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Titusi mwenikuwela na nenga, pamonga na yiwa awelile Myunani vilongosi hagha walasimisili ng'ogha kumyingisa jandu. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Pamonga na yiwa pawelili na walongo waghangi wa uhwangi wenikupala Titusi ayingiswi jandu. Wandu hagha wajiyingisili kwa ukambenga na kulolesa lolesa hula upekesu tuwela nau kukukonganika na Kilisito Yesu, ili wapati kutughola tuweli wahusutu, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />ila katu tujumila ng'ogha chochosi wakipalile twenga tukikovekeli. Kwaikiva tupalile uchakaka wa Habali Maha uhighali vilavila kwa mwenga.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ila kwa wala wawoneka yiwa ni vilongosi, paikawela vilongosi au ng'ogha nenga inyongesela ng'ogha chochosi kukila niwelili nikikitangasa, kwaikiva Sapanga kangulamula ng'ogha kwa kulola mighalu muwoneku wa panje. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Badili ghaki wakalola yiwa nipeghwa na Sapanga lihengu lya kutangasila Habali Maha wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi, handa Petelo vila awelili kapeghwa kutangasa Habali Maha kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Kwaikiva, Sapanga mwenikuwela akighola lihengu kuutumikila wa mndumindumi Petelo kwa Wayahudi, ndiwa yulayula mwenikughola lihengu kuundumindumi ghangu kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Hinu, Yakobu na Petelo pamonga na Yohanawenikumanyika yiwa ni vilongosi wakulu kumapinga gha wenikumkwinila Kilisito, wakalola yiwa Sapanga kanihaghula kughola lihengu lyaki, hinu wakanijumila nenga pamonga na Balinaba. Wakalola yiwa ni maha twenga tukayendelela kughola lihengu paghati gha wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha, na weni wakayendelela kughola lihengu paghati gha Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ila kindu kimonga hela watuluwili kiwelile tukotoho kuisemwa kuwatanga wandu wakapuku, na hau ndiwa mghalu niwela nau kumoyu ghangu na niwela na luhujulu lwa kuughola.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angumngingama Petelo haku Anitiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ila Petelo pakahika ku Anitiokia nenga nikangingama nayu lipalalipala kwakikiva awelili kakosela. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Kwaikiva haku kuhyetu pambila gha amonga gha wandu wahumile kwa Yakobu kuhika, mweni Petelo awelile akilyegha pamonga na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha. Ila badili gha Wayahudi kuhuma kwa Yakobu kuhika Petelo akatumbula kulilekanisa na wandu wenikuwela Wayahudi ng'ogha, kwaikiva gha kutila wala wenikukwinila kuyingiswa jandu. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Hinu Petelo akaghola umbindingu, na wakwinila waghangi kula ku Anitiokia wakakongana na mweni kuumbindingu hau. Wakamghola hata Balinaba kuwela handa weni. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Panilolile yiwa wangukovekela ng'ogha chakaka gha Habali Maha, nikamkalipila Petelo kuulongolo gha kila mmonga. Nikalonga, “Petelo wenga ni Myahudi uwelili ungulikala baha handa mundu kawela ng'ogha Myahudi. Hinu kwakyani unguyesa kuwalasimisa wala wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi kulikala handa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi na Wayahudi ng'ogha wangulokolwa kwa kukwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Twenga twaweni ni Wayahudi chakaka kuhuma tuweleka, na ng'ogha handa wandu wa milima mighangi weni sambi. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Ila tungumanya yiwa mundu kangujumilwa ng'ogha na Sapanga yiwa kammaha kwa matendu gha malaghilo gha Musa ila kwa kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito. Hinu twenga hilahila, tumkwinila Kilisito Yesu ili tupati kujumilwa na Sapanga kwa kukwinila kupitila Yesu Kilisito, ng'ogha kwa kupitila gha malaghilo gha Musa, kwaikiva kwa kukovekela malaghilo gha musa kwahela hata mundu mmonga atejumilwa na Sapanga yiwa kammaha. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ikiwela twenga tungupalwa kugholwa wamaha na Sapanga kwa kukonganika na Kilisito, twenga weni tunguwoneka tuwela na sambi, ghuli, ng'ogha nagha? <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Kwaikiva panichenga kangi yala mavulo gha malaghilo niwelile niyabomola kala, hinu nenga ninguhighilisa yiwa nitenyula laghilo. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kwaikiva kukovekelana na malaghilo nenga nihova, na kihu haki kiyambuswa na laghililo. Ili nenga nipati kulama kwa kumkovekela Sapanga. Nenga nihova pamonga na Kilisito kunani gha lipingika. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Kwa nagha, ng'ogha nenga mwenikuwela ningulama, ila ni Kilisito mwenikulikala mghati gha nenga. Na inguwela nagha kwaikiva gha kumkwinila Mwana wa Sapanga mwenikunipala na kuhova kwaikiva gha nenga. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Nenga nikanila ng'ogha umaha wa Sapanga. Handa mundu angugholwa wamaha kwa kukovekela laghililo, hinu Kilisito ahovile yahiyahi.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kukwinila au kukovekela Malaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Mwenga wandu wa kumlima wa Galatia, mwenga mwa wandyungi! Ni ghani mweni kuwagholela uhawi? Kwaikiva habali zya kuvambwa kwa Yesu Kilisito kulipingika zilongelilwi lipala lipala kwa mwenga. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Nenga ningupala kumanya mghalu mmonga hela, ghuli, mpokelili Mpumulo wa Sapanga kwaikiva mtimilisa malaghilo gha Musa au kwa kuhyoghanila na kukwinila Habali Maha? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Mwenga mwa wandu wa ghuli? Mwenga mtumbulile hyogha kwa mtanga wa Sapanga, Hinu kwa kyani hinaa mngupala kuhyomola kwa makakala gha mwenga maweni? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ghuli, mngupala kutulangiha yiwa kila mghasikili kiwelili kya yaghi? Nenga ngana yawela ng'ogha gha yaghi! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ninguwakonya kangi, ghuli mnguliwachila yiwa Sapanga anguwapegha Mpumulo ghaki na kughola makangaso paghati gha mwenga kwaikiva mnguyitikila malaghilo ampeghili Musa au kwaikiva mkwinila Habali Maha mhyoghanilile kupitila Kilisito?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Handa vila mayandiko yangulongela kwa Abulahamu, “Mweni amkwinilile Sapanga, na Sapanga akamjumila kuwela mmaha.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Hinu mngupalwa kumanya yiwa wala wenikukwinila ndiwa wana wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Mayandiko yalongelili kila kingalihumila kumachuwa gha kuulongolo. Mayandiko hagha yailongile yiwa Sapanga angaliwaghola wala wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi kuwela wajumilwa na mweni kuulongolo ghaki kwa kupitila kukwinila. Sapanga alongelili Habali Maha hazi kwa Abulahamu pambila gha kuhumila hagha. Sapanga amlongelili Abulahamu, “Kwa kupitila wenga, nitewahighila wandu wogha kumlimawogha.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Hinu, Sapanga atewahighila vilavila wandu wogha weni kumkwinila Kilisito handa aighola kwa Abulahamu vila amkwinilile Sapanga.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Wala wenikulikala kwa kuwachila hela kutimilisa malaghilo, watekolwa na mahakata, kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga, “Akolwi na mahakata mundu yeyosi mweni kutimilisa ng'ogha hyogha yayandikwa kukihitabu kya malaghilo na kuyitikila.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Hinu kwahela mundu mweni kujumilwa na Sapanga kwa kutimilisa malaghilo. Mayandiko gha Sapanga hilahila yangulongela, “Mundu mweni kujumilwa na Sapanga atelikala kwa kunikwinila.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Malaghilo apeghilwi Musa yangupala ng'ogha mundu mweni kuyatimilisa aweli na kukwinila ila ayatimilisi. Kumayandiko gha Sapanga iyandikwa, “Mundu atewela mkomu kwa kutimilisa hyogha yenikupalwa kumalaghilo gha Musa.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Hinu tungulola yiwa Kilisito atukombolile kuhuma kukukolwa na mahakata kwaikiva gha kutola mahakata gha twenga, kwaikiva kumayandiko gha Sapanga iyandikwa, “Kakolwa na mahakata mundu yula mweni kuning'iniswa kunani mwa lubiki.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Mgholu hau uhumilili, lukani hila highili apeghilwi Abulahamu iwahikili wandu wa milima mighangi kwa njila gha Kilisito, ili kwa kukwinila, tumpokeli yula Mpumulo Sapanga atulongelile yiwa atetupegha.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukovekela malaghilo na kukwinila lilaghano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Walongo wa nenga, nitetumila mlandano mmonga wa ngalilu gha kila lelo. Ikiwela mjumilana kwa kuyandika na mundu kukindu kitenu, kwahela mundu mwenikuwesa kughalambula au kuhumisa mghalu hau. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Sapanga avikili lilaghano kwa Abulahamu na waweleka ghaki. Mayandiko yangulonga ng'ogha yiwa na “Waweleka ghaki.” Kulangiha yiwa watangala, ila Mayandiko yangulonga, “Ka mheleka ghaki” kulangiha ni mundu mmonga na mweni ndiwa Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Kila ningupala kukilongela ni yiwa, malaghilo gha Musa yeni kuhika machuva gha imia njechi na iselasini yanguwesa ng'ogha kughalambula lilaghano lya Sapanga lyeni kuwela pambila. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ikiwela hupo gha Sapanga ingupeghwa kwa kukovekela laghilo, hinu kupeghwa hupo hai kutewesa ng'ogha kutegemela lilaghano lya Sapanga. Ila Sapanga ampeghili hupo Abulahamu kwaikiva amlaghinili.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Hinu kwakyani pakawela na laghilo? Lilaghano liyeghilwi kuulongolo kwaikiva gha mahakata yala wangughola wandu. Ila laghilo lingayendelela kughola lihengu mbaka kuhika kwa mheleka wa Abulahamu. Hayu ni mheleka mweni kukemwa kulilaghano lilongelilwi na Sapanga. Ila lilaghano liyeghilwi kupitila watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kwa kumtumila mghola ndulumu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Kiuchakaka mghola ndulumu kangupalwa ng'ogha kuwela, ikiwela mghalu weni ni wa mundu mmonga, na Sapanga ni mmonga hela.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa kuyegha laghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ghuli malaghilo, yangungingamana na lilaghano lya Sapanga? Ng'ogha nagha! Handa malaghilo ghala yayeghilwi yangaliwesa kuwapegha wandu ukomu, hinu kujumilwa na Sapanga tungalipeghwa kwa kupitila malaghilo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ila Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga yiwa sambi ingumlongosa kila mmonga, hinu weni kukwinila wapati hila hupo walaghinilwi na Sapanga kwa kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Pambila gha kuhika kwa kukwinila, laghilo lituvikili mkihungu mbaka lipindi hali lya kugubutulwa kukwinila. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Hinu laghilo liwelili handa kilongosi mbaka Kilisito pakahika, ili kwa kumkwinila mweni tupati kujumilwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Ila hinaa kumkwinila Kilisito kuhika kala, hinu tungulongoswa ng'ogha kangi na laghilo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Mwenga wogha kwa kupitila Kilisito Yesu muwela wana wa Sapanga kwa njila gha kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Hinu mwenga wogha wenikukonganika na Yesu Kilisito kwa njila gha kubatiswa, ni handa vila mumvala Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kwa nagha, muwela ng'ogha na mlekanu paghati gha Myahudi na Myahudi ng'ogha, mhusutu na mundu mweni kulekeselwa, mlumi na mdala. Wogha mngulandana ku Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Kangi kwaikiva mwenga ni wandu wa Kilisito, hinu mwenga mnguwela waweleka wa Abulahamu. Mwenga ndiwa mtepokela highili zyogha zila Sapanga amlongelile Abulahamu.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Kwa nagha kila ningupala kuwalongela ni yiwa yula mwenikupalwa kulihi pakawela mnung'una angulandana na mhusutu, Pamonga na yiwa vindu vyogha ni vya mweni. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Lipindi lya unung'una ghaki angupalwa kuwayitikila wala wahaghulilwa kumlongosa, mbaka lipindi lila livikwa na tati ghaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Hilahila na twenga tuwelili handa wana lipindi Kilisito kahika ng'ogha, tuwelili wahusutu wa ndyangilu gha wandu wa mlima wogha hau. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ila lipindi lila livikwa na Sapanga palihika kala Sapanga akamlaghila Mwana ghaki kumlimawogha, hayu mweni kuwela mundu handa twenga na mweni akayitikila malaghilo gha Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />ili awakomboli wala wandu wenikuwela wakilongoswa na laghilo, Ili tupati kupokela zila hupo zitimila zya kugholwa wana wa Sapanga.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Hinu kwaikiva mwenga muwela wana, Sapanga akamlaghila Mpumulo wa Mwana ghaki kumioyu gha mwenga, mwenikutughola tumkemi Sapanga ni Tati wa twenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Kwa nagha wenga kwamuhusutu ng'ogha kangi, ila uwela mwana, na kwaikiva wenga kwa mwana, Sapanga kakughola hilahila wenga kuwela mpokela hupo zila alongilile atawapegha wana ghaki.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Holu gha Paulo kwa Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Haku dahile, pamuwelili mummanya ng'ogha Sapanga muwelili wahusutu wa kukovekela milungu iwelili gha uchakaka ng'ogha. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ila hinaa mngummanya Sapanga wa chakaka, au nilongi Sapanga anguwamanya mwenga. Hinu kwakyani mnguhuyila kukovekela ndyangilu gha dahile yeni kulepelela kuwalokola na ghamaha ng'ogha? Mngupala iwagholi kangi muweli wahusutu? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mmbila mngukovekela mihambu gha machuwa na miei na mipindi na machuva! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ninguwela na holu kwa mwenga yiwa pangi lihengu nighola kwa mwenga ili kuwatanga mwenga linguwesa kuwela lya yaghiyaghi.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Walongo wa nenga ninguwaluwa muweli handa nenga, kwaikiva nenga ni handa mwenga mnigholela ng'ogha mghalu mhakata. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Mngumanya yiwa uvina niwelili nau, ndiwa kindu kinipeghili fwasi gha kuwatangasila mwenga Habali Maha. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Pamonga na yiwa kuvina kwa nenga kuwapeghili mwenga maghaso, mwenga mnikanila ng'ogha, ila mnipokelili handa mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, au handa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Lipindi lila muwelili na luheku nesu. Ghuli ni niki kiwahumila? Ninguwesa kulonga yiwa handa ingaliwesekana, mngalitupula hata mihu gha mwenga na kunipegha nenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Kwa hinaa nenga niwela mhakata wa mwenga kwa kuwalongela uchakakaa?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Wavula wogha wa uhwangi wanguyangala nesu kuwahekelesa mwenga, ila wangupala ng'ogha mwenga mpati ghamaha, kwaikiva wangupala mleki kuniyoghanila nenga na muwayoghanile weni. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ni maha lipindi lyogha kughola mighalu ghamaha, na ng'ogha kughola nagha pamuwela na nenga hela. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Wana ghangu, nenga ningukolwa na lusungu nesu handa nyongo vila angukolwa na lusungu lipindi lya kuiwopola, na niteyendelela kuwela nagha mbaka ndyangilu gha Kilisito iwoneki mghati gha mwenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Niwela na luhujulu kulikala na mwenga hinaa, ili nilongeli na mwenga kwa unyalinyali, ningukolwa na holu kwa mwenga.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa Hajili na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Amonga gha mwenga mngupala kulongoswa na laghilo. Ghuli, mwenga mngumanya laghilo vila lingulonga? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Kwaikiva iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga yiwa Abulahamu awelili na wana waivili walumi, mmonga kwa nyongo mwenikuwela mhusutu ghaki na mghangi kwa nyongo mwenikuwela mpekesu ghaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Yula mwana wa muhusutu ghaki awelekili handa wandu waghangi, ila yula wa mpekesu awelekili kwa vila Sapanga alaghanili. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Mighalu hai iwela mlandano, kwaikiva hagha waivili ni mlandano wa malaghano maivili. Lilaghano lya mtumbulo, ni lila ligholokili kulitumbi lya Sinai, lyeni kulela wana wa uhusutu. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hinu Hajili angulandana na litumbi Sinai lyeni kuwela haku Alabuni, kangi kalandana na mbwani wa Yelusalemu vila uwela kumlimawogha kwaikiva wana ghaki wawela kuuhusutu gha malaghilo wapeghilwi kulitumbi lya Sinai. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ila Sala, yula mhumbu mwenikuwela mpekesu, angugholokela Yelusalemu gha kundumba. Na mweni ndiwa nyongu gha twenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Uhekeleli wenga mdala mweni kuwela ungali kulela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">utovi lilowi, ukuwi vilulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">wenga mweni kukolwa ng'ogha na lusungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kwaikiva wana wa mhumbu alekilwi ni watangala kupiti wa yula mwenikuwela na mngwana.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Hinu na mwenga walongo ghangu ni wana wa Sapanga weni kuweleka kukovekelana na kila akilongelile Sapanga handa iwela kwa Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ila handa iwela machuwa ghala gha kuweleka wana yula mweni kuweleka handa wana waghangi akamchokola yula mweni kuweleka kwa makakala gha Mpumulo. Ndiwa inguwoneka na lelo. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ila Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga niki? “Mtimuli mhumbu muhusutu pamonga na mwana ghaki, kwaikiva mwana wa mhumbu muhusutu katu atelihi pamonga na mwana wa mhumbu mwenikuwela mpekesu.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Walongo wa nenga twenga twa wana wa mhumbu mwenikuwela mpekesu na ng'ogha yula mhumbu mwenikuwela mhusutu.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Muugholokeli upekesu wa mwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Hinaa tuwela pekesu, kwaikiva Kilisito atuvikili pekesu, hinu muweli mgangamala kuupekesu hau. Mkotoho kumlekesela mundu yeyosi awayingisi kuuhusutu kangi.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Mhyoghanili! Nenga, Paulo, ninguwalongela yiwa handa pamjumila kuyingiswa jandu ili mjumilwi na Sapanga, hinu Kilisito yala agholili yatewela ng'ogha na fwaida kwa mwenga. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Kangi ningulongela kwa kila mmonga wa mwenga, mweni kuyingiswa jandu yiwa angupalwa kutimilisa malaghilo hyogha. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Mwenga wandu wenikupala muwoneki wamaha kupitila malaghilo mlekaniswa na Kilisito, kangi mkanila umaha wa Sapanga. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ila twenga tungulindila kwa litumaini, kwa makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga, atugholi tujumilwi na Sapanga kwa kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Handa mundu pakawela na Kilisito Yesu, kuyingiswa jandu au kukotoho kuyingiswa jandu vinguwela ng'ogha na fwaida yeyosi. Ungupalwa kuwela na kukwinila ili kuwapala waghangi.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Muwelili na ndyangilu gha maha, hinu ghani kawaghola mkotoho kuyitikila chakaka? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ghuli, Sapanga mweni kuwakema ndiwa mweni kuyambusa hali? <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Handa ingulongwa, “Amila mayaghani ingusasisa ukowa wogha,” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />kwaikiva mwenga mngukongana na Bambu Yesu. Nenga niwela na litumaini yiwa mtekovekela ng'ogha milando gha wandu waghangi, ila mtekovekela milando gha nenga. Kangi yeyosi mweni kuwakologhanisa mwenga, hayu atetoswa pamonga na yiwa kawela ghani.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ila walongo wa nenga, ikiwela nenga ningutangasa yiwa mwenikuyingiswa jandu angujumilwa na Sapanga, handa ingaliwela ningughola nagha, kwakyani hinaa ninguhakilwa? Handa ningaliyendelela kutangasa kuyingiswa jandu, hinu kutangasa kwa nenga habali zya lipingika lya Yesu kungawesa ng'ogha kuwahyomelesa. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ningalipala wala wogha weni kuwabyodosa mwenga wailingisi jandu weni na wangalidumula vikongonu vya kulitundila.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Walongo wa nenga mwenga mkemilwi na Sapanga ili muweli pekesu, ila mkotoho kutumila upekesu hau handa njila gha kukovekela lumata mata lwa mlima wogha, ila mtumikilani mwenga kwa mwenga kwa upalo. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Kwaikiva laghilo lyogha zya Musa lingutimila kuamuli imonga, “Mpali myako handa ungulipala umweni.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ila handa mtelumana na kulalulana handa mikokolu, mkali mihu mkotoho mkayalamisana.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Hinu, ninguwalongela, mlikali kwa kulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, katu mtetimilisa ng'ogha lumatamata lwa kihigha, <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />kwaikiva lumatamata lwa mlima wogha lingujumilana ng'ogha na mighalu yeni kupalwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, na mighalu gha Mpumulo ingungingamana na lumatamata lwa kumlimawogha, mighalu hai miivili ingujumilana ng'ogha, kwa nagha mtewesa ng'ogha kughola ghala mnguyapala weni baha. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ila pamulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, mtewela ng'ogha wahusutu wa malaghilo apeghilwi Musa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Hinu mighalu gha kihigha ingumanyikana na yeni ni hai, ngongola na ndyangilu gha maha ng'ogha na matendu gha honi, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kuyupa ming'omung'omu na uhawi na uhakata na magombi na wifu na lilaka na uwimi na kubisana na makologhanyu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ukotoho kuvika lumatamata kuhindu gha myako, ulowela, kulyegha lyegha na mighalu mighangi handa hai. Ninguwalongela kangi handa niilongile, wandu wenikughola mighalu handa hai wateupokela ng'ogha unkosi wa Sapanga uweli wa weni.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ila pamlongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga mweni atewaghola muweli na kupalana na luheku na kuponga na kufumilila na umaha na kutangana na uchakaka, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />unyalinyali na kuikanisa mweni. Kwahela laghilo lyeni kuwesa kulonga mighalu hai ni mihakata. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Wandu wogha wenikuwela wa Kilisito Yesu wavamba kala ngalilu ghao gha kimundu pamonga na lumatamata lwaki lwa kihigha. Walekana na umundu hau wa dahile weni ndyangilu gha kimlimawogha na wenikuwapala wagholi mighalu mihakata. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga kayambusa twenga tulami, hinu tungupalwa tumkovekeli mweni atulongosi. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Hinu tukotoho kuitutumula wenibaha, tungupalwa ng'ogha kuchokolana kwa kusindana twenga kwa twenga au kulolelana wifu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Mfumilani na kutangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Walongo wa nenga, paikawela mundu kawoneka na uhakata mtenu, mwenga wenikulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga mumkanisi mundu hayu ili aleki sambi kwa njila gha unyalinyali. Na kila mmonga wa mwenga akali mihu, lukani akotoho kughola mahakata hilahila. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Mtangani mwenga kwa mwenga pamnguwela kulung'ai, kwa kughola nagha mngughola handa Kilisito angupala. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Kwaikiva mundu pakailola yiwa angumanya nesu na kunu kangumanya ng'ogha, hayu anguingonga mweni. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Ila kila mundu na aweli na ndyangilu maheli, ndiwa atewela na lukani lwa kuisifila, akileka kuilandanisa na mundu mghangi. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Hinu kila mundu na agholi lihengu angupalwa kughola.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mpeghani mighalu hyogha maheli na mundu yeyosi mweni kukuvula kila akilongelile Sapanga.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mkotoho kululunganyika, kwahela mundu mweni kuhigha mighalu ghaki kuulongolo gha Sapanga, kwaikiva kila akikulila mundu ndiwa atekibena. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Mundu pakaghola ghala yeni kumhekelesa mweni, atebena uyalamisu, na mwenikulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga utepokela ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Hinu tukotoho kuleka kughola ghamaha, kwaikiva patughola maheli bila kutoka na kutenyuka ng'ogha moyu hinu tutebena ghamaha lipindi palihika. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Kwa nagha, kwa vila tungupokela fwasi na tuwagholeli wandu wogha ghamaha, nesu nesu wala walongo weni kumkwinila Kilisito handa twenga.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyomolela lihamba lyaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Hau ni myandiku ghangu mweni, mnguwesa kulola vila milando inguwoneka kuwela mikulukulu. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Wandu wala wenikuyesa kuwalasimisa mwenga kuyingiswa jandu wangughola nagha, ili wawahekelesi Wayahudi wayau. Wangutila wakotoho wakahakilwa kwaikiva gha kutangasa Habali gha lipingika lya Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Hata wala weni kuyingiswa jandu weni wanguyitikila ng'ogha malaghilo. Na wambila wangupala mwenga myingiswi jandu ili wawesi kuitutumula yiwa wawavika kilangihi kumihigha gha mwenga. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ila nenga niisifila ng'ogha chochosi kihyetu na kihu kya Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito kulipingika, kwaikiva kukovekelana na kihu kyaki mighalu hyogha gha mlima wogha hau yangunitanga ng'ogha na ngalilu ghangu gha dahile ihova kupitila kihu kya Bambu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kwaikiva kuyingiswa jandu au kukotoho kuyingiswa jandu kwa kindu ng'ogha, ila kya maha ni kuwela kiumbi kihyonu. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Kuponga na luhungu vyeni kuhuma kwa Sapanga viweli na wandu wogha weni kukovekela uchakaka hau, kwaikiva weni ndiwa wandu wa Sapanga.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Hinu, kutumbula hinaa mundu akotoho kunighasa kangi kwaikiva niwela na vilangihi vya vilonda kumhigha ghangu, vinikolile kwaikiva gha kumkovekela hayu Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Walongo wa nenga, umaha wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito uweli pamonga na mwenga wogha. Hina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>